{"parse":{"title":"Truth Prevails","pageid":491534,"revid":2189682,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Truth Prevails</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/50/Talent_Truth_Prevails.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031040\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Truth Prevails\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/50/Talent_Truth_Prevails.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031040\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/50/Talent_Truth_Prevails.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031040 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/50/Talent_Truth_Prevails.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031040 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Truth Prevails\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Truth_Prevails.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Truth Prevails.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\">Vesna</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/4th_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"4th Ascension Passive\">4th Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Radiance: Stellar Swirl: Vesna will gain the corresponding effect based on the Elemental Type of her party members:<ul><li>For every <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Cryo\" title=\"Cryo\">Cryo</a></b></span> or <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Anemo\" title=\"Anemo\">Anemo</a></b></span> character in her current party, Vesna's ATK increases by 6%; and</li><li>For every character of all other Elemental Types in her current party, Vesna's Elemental Mastery increases by 25 instead.</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Truth Prevails</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\">Vesna</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/4th_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"4th Ascension Passive\">4th Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fge